{"D:\\wt\\ssimple2\\vlog\\ssimple2\\voz\\b000_t2.wav": {"text": "This is my mother at 95, in her little kitchen in Osaka, and she lived 6 more years after this picture. She died at 101, in the same small wooden house where she raised 5 children. After she turned 60, she did not start a lot of new things. She stopped doing 9 things. Today I will tell you all 9, the way she told them to me. And number nine is sitting in your cupboard right now, wrapped in paper, waiting for a day that is never coming. One of them she did every single morning at 6.30 in the park with 40 neighbors. Another one is a little notebook she kept by her pillow for almost 40 years. But first, one honest thing. I cannot promise you 101. Nobody can. This is not advice from a clinic. This is just how one old woman lived, busy and happy, until the very last year.", "words": [{"w": " This", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.24}, {"w": " is", "s": 0.24, "e": 0.42}, {"w": " my", "s": 0.42, "e": 0.58}, {"w": " mother", "s": 0.58, "e": 0.86}, {"w": " at", "s": 0.86, "e": 1.1}, {"w": " 95,", "s": 1.1, "e": 2.22}, {"w": " in", "s": 2.22, "e": 2.32}, {"w": " her", "s": 2.32, "e": 2.48}, {"w": " little", "s": 2.48, "e": 2.76}, {"w": " kitchen", "s": 2.76, "e": 3.14}, {"w": " in", "s": 3.14, "e": 3.36}, {"w": " Osaka,", "s": 3.36, "e": 4.4}, {"w": " and", "s": 4.4, "e": 4.44}, {"w": " she", "s": 4.44, "e": 4.66}, {"w": " lived", "s": 4.66, "e": 4.96}, {"w": " 6", "s": 4.96, "e": 5.32}, {"w": " more", "s": 5.32, "e": 5.6}, {"w": " years", "s": 5.6, "e": 5.98}, {"w": " after", "s": 5.98, "e": 6.36}, {"w": " this", "s": 6.36, "e": 6.6}, {"w": " picture.", "s": 6.6, "e": 7.48}, {"w": " She", "s": 7.6, "e": 7.72}, {"w": " died", "s": 7.72, "e": 8.1}, {"w": " at", "s": 8.1, "e": 8.36}, {"w": " 101,", "s": 8.36, "e": 9.66}, {"w": " in", "s": 9.66, "e": 9.94}, {"w": " the", "s": 9.94, "e": 10.12}, {"w": " same", "s": 10.12, "e": 10.52}, {"w": " small", "s": 10.52, "e": 11.02}, {"w": " wooden", "s": 11.02, "e": 11.36}, {"w": " house"